  "body": "Some of them are generic like `generate_config` and `hash_password` and ought to include a `synapse_` prefix or similar. We might consider pruning these if they're not useful too. These are things that eventually end up on people's `PATH`s with no context. We should choose names carefully and respectfully.\r\n\r\nWe should be able to effect any renames by changing setup.py/pyproject.toml and possibly the debian package config. We shouldn't need to rename any script files within the project. We'll also need to mention this in the upgrading notes.",
